{
  "id": "6a711e982bde6110547a5d0f",
  "title": "期間の幾何平均",
  "created": 1785798300,
  "updated": 1785800258,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a711e982bde6110547a5d0f",
      "text": "期間の幾何平均",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798300,
      "updated": 1785798300
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7121130000000000da6b50",
      "text": "[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798930,
      "updated": 1785798931
    },
    {
      "id": "6a711e9c0000000000da6b41",
      "text": "データの開始時点[$ s]と終了時点[$ d]が与えられている時に、ソート可能な1つの値を設定したい",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798300,
      "updated": 1785798719
    },
    {
      "id": "6a711ec70000000000da6b43",
      "text": "\t[https://gyazo.com/b84e906edb49bc5c05fdae867b54574b]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798343,
      "updated": 1785798618
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7120450000000000da6b4b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798725,
      "updated": 1785798725
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7120450000000000da6b4c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798725,
      "updated": 1785798725
    },
    {
      "id": "6a711fe20000000000da6b49",
      "text": "何となく[算術平均][$ \\frac12(s+t)]を使いたくなるが、実態と合わない",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798625,
      "updated": 1785798812
    },
    {
      "id": "6a71209c0000000000da6b4e",
      "text": "\t人々の記憶に残るのは終了時点に近い側なので終了時点の方に重心を置きたい",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798812,
      "updated": 1785798838
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7120c00000000000da6b4f",
      "text": "[算術平均]以外の平均を用いると代表点が偏るのでこれを使おう",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798848,
      "updated": 1785799001
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7121280000000000da6b51",
      "text": "何となく[幾何平均]を用いてみる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798952,
      "updated": 1785798996
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7121380000000000da6b52",
      "text": "\t[$ \\sqrt{st}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785798968,
      "updated": 1785799017
    },
    {
      "id": "6a71217f0000000000da6b53",
      "text": "\t[$ s,t]の基準点を現在に設置する",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785799038,
      "updated": 1785799067
    },
    {
      "id": "6a71219c0000000000da6b55",
      "text": "\t\tよく見る数字を用いると期限0年を基準点にしてしまうため、計算により得られる[幾何平均]の値が[$ s]側に寄ってしまう",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785799068,
      "updated": 1785800178
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7121ea0000000000da6b56",
      "text": "計算テスト",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785799146,
      "updated": 1785799176
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7122090000000000da6b57",
      "text": "\t[https://gyazo.com/6b716f7af3adc05ff94790ae3258bc2b]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785799176,
      "updated": 1785800031
    },
    {
      "id": "6a71255f0000000000da6b58",
      "text": "\t基準点をずらすと値が変動してしまうのが気になる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785800031,
      "updated": 1785800050
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7125720000000000da6b59",
      "text": "\t\t目標と照らし合わせると値が変わっても順序が変動しなければOKではある",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785800050,
      "updated": 1785800088
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7125a30000000000da6b5a",
      "text": "\t\t順序の不変性を証明するのがダリィ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785800099,
      "updated": 1785800126
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7126390000000000da6b5b",
      "text": "\t沼が見えたので一旦終了",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785800249,
      "updated": 1785800258
    },
    {
      "id": "6a71218f0000000000da6b54",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1785799054,
      "updated": 1785799065
    }
  ]
}